OL,3,GNEWSADerailment disruptions
OL,4,Aunacceptable, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Months of significant disruption" to
OL,7,Frail passengers following a train
OL,8,Fderailment near Lewes are
OL,9,F"unacceptable", an East Sussex MP says.
OL,11,FThe line connecting Haywards Heath and
OL,12,FLewes, between Eastbourne and London,
OL,13,Fwas temporarily shut after the
OL,14,Fderailment on 13 August and passengers
OL,15,Ffaced speed restrictions and
OL,16,Fcancellations.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
