OL,3,GNEWSADerailment disruptions
OL,4,Aunacceptable, says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastbourne's Liberal Democrat MP Josh
OL,7,FBabarinde says he wants to see "rail
OL,8,Fbosses doing everything possible to
OL,9,Fminimise disruption and restore
OL,10,Freliable services as quickly as
OL,11,Fpossible".
OL,13,FA spokesperson for Network Rail and
OL,14,FGreater Thameslink Railway (GTR)
OL,15,Fapologised.
